yle={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 24, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 32}}>你们本来就要求「出事能还原」——现在把它也套上。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>16 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
